        "title": "Construct a right triangle",
        "text": "Construct a right triangle with angle $$\\theta$$ so that $$\\sin(\\theta)=x/3.$$ \\n Assume a triangle with opposite side length $$x$$ and hypotenuse $$3$$.\\n##figure1.gif##",
