        "text": "$$\\text{Adjacent}$$ $$=\\sqrt{3^2-x^2}=\\sqrt{9-x^2}$$. Since $$\\cos(\\theta)=\\text{Adj/Hyp},$$ divide your result by $$3$$.\\n##figure2.gif##",
